                                "zh": "我今天早上因为起得太早，所以脸色很<w>难看</w>。"
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Het personeel in die winkel is vaak erg <w>chagrijnig</w> tegen de klanten.",
                            "target_lang_translations": {
                                "en": "The staff in that shop are often very <w>bad-tempered</w> towards the customers.",
                                "zh": "那家店的店员对顾客经常表现得非常<w>烦躁</w>。"
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Ik ben hartstikke <w>chagrijnig</w> als ik niet eerst een aantal koppen koffie drink.",
                            "target_lang_translations": {
                                "en": "I am incredibly <w>cranky</w> if I don't drink a few cups of coffee first.",
                                "zh": "如果我不先喝几杯咖啡，我的<w>心情</w>就会非常糟糕。"
                            }
                        }
                    ],
